BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:linkedin-prospect-refill-2026-09-07-main@agentic-os
DTSTAMP:20260907T153431Z
DTSTART:20260907T160000Z
DTEND:20260907T173000Z
SUMMARY:AOS | Refill LinkedIn Prospect Pool
DESCRIPTION:AOS_OWNER=agentic-os\nAOS_ACTION_ID=aos-linkedin-prospect-refill-2026-09-07\nAOS_BLOCK_ID=linkedin-prospect-refill-2026-09-07-main\n\nOutcome: restore the private 222Emails LinkedIn verified prospect pool to at least 60 unused eligible prospects\, preferably 120 when practical\, without lowering the admission standard.\n\nTrigger: the private production batch for 7 Sep reports 23 eligible unused prospects remaining\, below the 36-prospect warning threshold and below the 60-prospect minimum refill target.\n\nExecution contract:\n1. Research and verify fresh appointment-led decision-makers using current public evidence.\n2. Admit only records that pass the private repo admission gate\, including named decision-maker\, canonical LinkedIn profile\, independent evidence\, 95+ first-touch quality\, finished connection note/post-accept copy\, second verification and red-team pass.\n3. Preserve business/profile dedupe and stale-evidence gates.\n4. LinkedIn actions remain manual. This block authorises research\, verification and inventory repair only. It does not authorise automated connection requests\, InMail or messages.\n5. Stop when the minimum 60 unused verified prospects is restored or the timebox ends. If incomplete\, re-evaluate at the next Agentic OS noon reconciliation rather than auto-carrying the task.\n\nSource authority: Chelston222/222emails-linkedin-ops README.md + REPLENISH.md + latest private batch inventory.\nOwned by Agentic OS. Manual calendar events remain protected.
X-AOS-ID:linkedin-prospect-refill-2026-09-07-main
X-AOS-ACTION-ID:aos-linkedin-prospect-refill-2026-09-07
X-AOS-TASK-ID:aos-linkedin-prospect-refill-2026-09-07
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
